# Local development variables for the dusk Worker.
# Copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored) and fill in real values.
# Never commit real secrets.
#
# DUSK_ORIGIN has been removed. The runtime is now a Cloudflare Durable Object
# (DuskRuntimeDO) bound via the DUSK_RUNTIME binding in wrangler.jsonc.
# DUSK_GATEWAY_TOKEN authorizes the Worker-to-Durable-Object boundary only.
# Configure DUSK_SIGNING_KEY separately as a Container secret, never in this file.
DUSK_GATEWAY_TOKEN=
